<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>You think of it as an ordinary place... I see...<PG>
In this modern society, and especially within Japan, this is an age in which avoiding civilization is all but impossible. 
{PAUSE ""}
Perhaps the Arata settlement, too, is more modernized than one would expect.<PG>
{}
